-- The Black Morass (map 269), instance_black_morass, its trash and its bosses: its C++ as rows -- EPIC10 tier 2.
-- Written by the trt repo's scripts/tier2/a20_black_morass.py from t1_world; black_morass_restore.sql puts
-- back what this replaces. R8: a person applies it, into the world database.
--
-- The C++ keeps its script names: mod-black-morass is the switch (AM1, handoff/manager-091).
-- Loaded, the C++ runs as before -- a script found by name comes first. Unloaded
-- (`module unload mod-black-morass`, which gives every creature standing a new AI at once),
-- the names find no script and the creatures run these rows (their ai_name).
--
-- Map 269 keeps instance_black_morass: with mod-black-morass unloaded a map made then gets the generic
-- store (AC7), and its rows for a player entering (AC9) run only on such a map (condition 63 reversed).
-- The fall check is a per-player loop of a second (the C++ checked every update), ending as he leaves;
-- a player out and in again within that second runs two for a while. An Unknown Entity is the first
-- player's summon (the C++ summoned it from the map) -- it does not go with him.
-- Approximations: the Riftguard charges his own victim casting (the C++ any caster within 50 yd, from 5 s);
-- the Riftweaver's Darken Vision and the shades' spells go at the victim, its range the spell's;
-- Antnormi's timed enrage is her own (the C++ cast it at her victim); Epochronos's +25 % cast time
-- under 25 % has no row (only his yell); a shade's Screams never fired in the C++ and has no row; the
-- Harbinger's volleys at 80/60/40/20 % (the C++ every 20 % lost since the last); Gerastrasz sets his
-- echo alight once per threshold (the C++ kept trying every update while a dead one's guid stayed).
-- Rotmaw's meal is let out 16 s on (the C++ 15.5 s) at full size (the C++ its native scale); a player he
-- consumed who leaves the map first stays shrunk until he relogs, as in the C++. Chronormu's evade
-- now ends as an evade does (the C++ never left combat), and his active-object state has no row. His
-- frenzy emote is script text -1000005 "%s goes into a frenzy!": the C++'s -1000001 is not in script_texts.
-- Needs the core of trt/module-structure with SET_HEALTH on mana (b6dc7775) and the SQL of AC7 and AC9.

